<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Umer Khayyam BBQ</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#111;
color:#fff;
}

header{
background:#000;
padding:15px;
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
position:sticky;
top:0;
}

header h1{
color:red;
}

nav a{
color:white;
margin:10px;
text-decoration:none;
}

.hero{
background:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.6),rgba(0,0,0,.6)),
url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529193591184-b1d58069ecdd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80");
background-size:cover;
background-position:center;
height:80vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
}

.hero h2{
font-size:50px;
}

.hero p{
margin:20px;
font-size:20px;
}

.btn{
display:inline-block;
padding:15px 30px;
background:red;
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
border-radius:30px;
margin:10px;
}

section{
padding:50px 10%;
}

h2{
color:red;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

table{
width:100%;
border-collapse:collapse;
margin-top:20px;
}

th{
background:red;
padding:15px;
}

td{
padding:15px;
border:1px solid #555;
text-align:center;
}

tr:nth-child(even){
background:#222;
}

.contact{
text-align:center;
}

footer{
background:#000;
text-align:center;
padding:20px;
margin-top:40px;
}

@media(max-width:768px){

header{
flex-direction:column;
}

.hero h2{
font-size:35px;
}

table{
font-size:14px;
}

}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<header>

<h1>Umer Khayyam BBQ</h1>

<nav>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#menu">Menu</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

</header>

<section class="hero">

<div>

<h2>Authentic Pakistani BBQ</h2>

<p>Serving Delicious BBQ Since 2009</p>

<a class="btn" href="#menu">View Menu</a>

<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/923006046400">
Order on WhatsApp
</a>

</div>

</section>

<section id="about">

<h2>About Us</h2>

<p>

Welcome to <b>Umer Khayyam BBQ</b>.

We are proudly serving delicious BBQ in Sargodha since <b>2009</b>.

Fresh ingredients, traditional recipes and quality service have made us one of the favorite BBQ restaurants in the area.

</p>

<br>

<p>

<b>Founder & CEO</b><br>

Muhammad Nasser Nazir Bhatti

</p>

</section>

<section id="menu">

<h2>BBQ Menu</h2>

<table>

<tr>
<th>Item</th>
<th>Price</th>
</tr>

<tr><td>Beef Kabab</td><td>Rs.130</td></tr>
<tr><td>Chicken Kabab</td><td>Rs.140</td></tr>
<tr><td>Chicken Tikka</td><td>Rs.160</td></tr>
<tr><td>Beef Tikka</td><td>Rs.130</td></tr>
<tr><td>Chicken Boneless Tikka</td><td>Rs.180</td></tr>
<tr><td>Leg Piece</td><td>Rs.400</td></tr>
<tr><td>Chest Piece</td><td>Rs.430</td></tr>
<tr><td>Malai Boti</td><td>Rs.350</td></tr>

</table>

</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact">

<h2>Contact Us</h2>

<p><b>Location:</b><br>
Khayyam Chowk, Railway Road, Sargodha
</p>

<br>

<p>

<b>Phone:</b><br>

<a style="color:white;" href="tel:+923006046400">
0300-6046400
</a>

</p>

<br>

<a class="btn"
href="https://wa.me/923006046400?text=Hello%20Umer%20Khayyam%20BBQ,%20I%20would%20like%20to%20place%20an%20order.">
Order Now
</a>

</section>

<footer>

<p>© 2026 Umer Khayyam BBQ</p>

<p>Since 2009</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
